@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "User" as User
participant "AccountPage" as UI
participant "App.jsx" as App
participant "AccountController" as Controller
participant "AccountService" as Service
participant "AppUserRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-03: Logout ==

User -> UI : 1. Click "Sign out"
activate User
activate UI

UI -> App : 2. logout()
activate App

App -> App : 3. Validate UI state and build request
activate App
deactivate App

App -> Controller : 4. POST /api/account/logout
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. logout()
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. currentUser(); revokeAllTokens(user)
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Repo : 7. current authenticated AppUser
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. JWT filter SELECT app_user\nWHERE email = ?
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. AppUser with authVersion
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 11. Increment authVersion; transaction dirty-check
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Missing or revoked JWT -> HTTP 401
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 12. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 13. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> App : 14. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

App -> App : 15. Clear session, membership and notifications
activate App
deactivate App

App --> UI : 16. Navigate to HomePage as guest
deactivate App

UI --> User : 17. Updated screen or error feedback

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
